<title>JAPAN: Keihin Express Rail - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Keihin Express Rail - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		295.55		vs	  269.56</p>
<p> Operating	   17.80		vs	   21.44</p>
<p> Current		4.03		vs	    5.99</p>
<p> Net		  755    million    vs	    1.14</p>
<p> EPS		    1.50 yen	  vs	    2.33 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	  1.48 yen	  vs	    2.32 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Keihin Electric Express Railway Co Ltd operates a line between Tokyo, Yokohama and the Miura Peninsula.</p>
